<title>USA: American Technical sees Q1 revs above yr ago.</title>
<headline>American Technical sees Q1 revs above yr ago.</headline>
<dateline>HUNTINGTON, N.Y. 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Technical Ceramics Corp said Friday it expects first quarter revenues to exceed last year's first quarter revenues of $7.85 million.</p>
<p>Current order patterns have moderated from the levels seen in the early part of fiscal year 1996, but American Technical said it believes it remains well positioned to deal with current market conditions.</p>
<p>American Techical manufactures ceramic and porcelain capacitors to store and discharge precise amounts of power in electrical circuits.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
